# AutoBleem C++ code style: LLVM with 4-space indents and 120 columns, as AutoBleem-NG's (its
# autobleem/.clang-format), plus two choices of our own - access modifiers at the class's column (every
# header here writes "public:" that way) and no top-level function collapsed onto one line (each carries
# a //*** banner). tools/format.sh [--check] runs it over the tree; make_win.sh runs the check.
# Requires clang-format 20 or newer (MSYS2: mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-clang-tools-extra).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120
SortIncludes: false
AccessModifierOffset: -4
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
